    "name": "Flag or Rage",
    "steam_appid": 2891270,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flag or Rage is a physics-based platformer game for up to 8 players!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose and place obstacles and platforms, cooperate with your teammates to reach the top and capture the flag, or cunningly hinder your opponents and survive alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You can't play alone!! I recommend playing with a friend.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete against opponents to choose obstacles or platforms and place them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use various items to step on your teammates and opponents, reach the top, and capture the flag.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As night falls, darkness creeps in. Avoid the darkness and survive alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even after reaching the top or being eliminated, you can still hinder the remaining opponents. Continuously disrupt and seek revenge on your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Duo Mode (2vs2vs2vs2)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cooperate with your teammate and sabotage your opponents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Squad Mode (4vs4)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work closely with your teammates to overcome seemingly impossible terrain and reach the top.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Solo Mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everyone is your enemy. Step on your opponents, reach the top, or survive alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online multiplayer for up to 8 players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique and competitive obstacle selection mechanism.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two victory conditions: reach the top or survive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Consistent and cohesive graphics.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flag or Rage is a physics-based platformer game for up to 8 players!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose and place obstacles and platforms, cooperate with your teammates to reach the top and capture the flag, or cunningly hinder your opponents and survive alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You can't play alone!! I recommend playing with a friend.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete against opponents to choose obstacles or platforms and place them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use various items to step on your teammates and opponents, reach the top, and capture the flag.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As night falls, darkness creeps in. Avoid the darkness and survive alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even after reaching the top or being eliminated, you can still hinder the remaining opponents. Continuously disrupt and seek revenge on your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Duo Mode (2vs2vs2vs2)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cooperate with your teammate and sabotage your opponents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Squad Mode (4vs4)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work closely with your teammates to overcome seemingly impossible terrain and reach the top.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Solo Mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everyone is your enemy. Step on your opponents, reach the top, or survive alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online multiplayer for up to 8 players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique and competitive obstacle selection mechanism.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two victory conditions: reach the top or survive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Consistent and cohesive graphics.</p></li></ul>",
